{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，人物动机的因果解释和跨段叙事的连贯性不如Y充分，尤其是后半段人物如何从犹疑走向决定，Y交代得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的主线句更短，重点词有明显的视觉锚点，感受文字又有大小层级和随乐段出现的时间安排，普通观众边听边扫，更容易抓住每段的情绪落点。它还保留了较丰富的音型、力度、音色和情绪转折，感受不容易流于笼统。Y在解释人物为什么纠结、前后心理如何转变方面更完整，但较长的叙述占用了更多阅读注意力，音乐感受也有一定程度的概括化。综合来看，我选X，因为它更好地兼顾了扫读、段落重点和音乐体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "85396bb7-d4b9-4b21-963f-d2f113f95a7d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T220648712217Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:07:48.161222+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18a814fa1f3c328ef9ef3de0b40b2a9408facad0a4bf5b88b13f3b041922fc84", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web